# Delvers S1E09 — Once a Month Goat

**Source-identity follow-up, 2026-10-27:** The [S1E12–S1E08 batch check](../../reports/DELVERS_S1E12_S1E08_SOURCE_IDENTITY_2026-10-27.md#s1e09) verifies both complete local exports against their recorded Git blobs after CRLF-to-LF conversion only, and verifies both source paths in the recorded source commit. Raw bytes differ in line endings. This independently confirms local content correspondence with the originally pinned source revision. Earlier provenance statements remain dated history. Prior interpretive coverage, inter-ASR measurements, played cutoff and audio status are unchanged.

**Campaign and type:** *Delvers*, season one episode **S1E09 — Once a Month Goat**; played session immediately after [S1E08](S1E08.md), not Wastes or Inverse. Opening tea advertisement and edited recap, interval/break comments and closing advancement announcement are out-of-game framing.

**Status 2026-10-25:** **ASR-provisional text research**. The complete processed Parakeet SRT was reviewed chronologically from introduction to network outro (**02:52:48.130**). Both complete SRT streams were tokenized for exact ordered comparison; Qwen Q8 was selectively checked at high-risk combat, artifact handoff, payment, family, cave/temple, and shopping passages, **not independently close-read as full prose**. No original MP3 listened to, audio-clock alignment verified, Discord tactical maps viewed, guild guide inspected anew or historical character sheets verified. [Comparison](../../reports/DELVERS_S1E09_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md) · [Research queue](../REVIEW_QUEUE.md).

